      "title": "gsm_a_rr: correct spare bits of Channel Description",
      "message": "gsm_a_rr: correct spare bits of Channel Description\n\nETSI 44.018: 10.5.2.5: spare bits are 3+4 and not 5+6. The counting\nin the spec might be confusing, because bits start at 8 not at 1.\n",
      "author_name": "Alexander Couzens",
      "author_email": "lynxis@fe80.eu",
      "authored_date": "2020-09-10T21:32:53.000+02:00",
